cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "EyeTrackingAnalysis: analysis code for visual-search and multiple-object-tracking eye-tracking experiments"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for the behavioural eye-tracking study reported in
  the associated manuscript: visual-search feature extraction, search-performance
  analyses, multiple-object-tracking analyses and the combined expertise index,
  with the full compute-environment definition and a single entry point (`run`)
  that executes all notebooks and writes every figure and table of the paper.
